## Environment Variables

Create a `.env` file in the project root. All fields are required unless a default is shown.

```env
# Runtime
ENV=development
LOG_LEVEL=INFO

# PostgreSQL
DB_USER=
DB_PASSWORD=
DB_HOST=
DB_PORT=5432
DB_NAME=

# Redis
REDIS_HOST=
REDIS_PORT=6379

# LLM APIs
GROQ_API_KEY=
GOOGLE_API_KEY=

# JWT
JWT_SECRET_KEY=
JWT_REFRESH_SECRET_KEY=
JWT_ALGORITHM=HS256
JWT_EXPIRATION_MINUTES=60
JWT_REFRESH_SECRET_KEY_EXPIRATION_DAYS=7

# Email (FastMail)
MAIL_USERNAME=
MAIL_PASSWORD=
MAIL_FROM=
MAIL_SERVER=
MAIL_PORT=587
MAIL_STARTTLS=true
MAIL_SSL_TLS=false

# Google Cloud Storage
GCS_BUCKET=

# Misc
HTTP_TIMEOUT=30
```

